.SS " Iterator[\fBMemoryHandler\fP] sphinx\&.util\&.logging\&.pending_logging ()"

.PP
.nf
Context manager to postpone logging all logs temporarily\&.

For example::

    >>> with pending_logging():
    >>>     logger\&.warning('Warning message!')  # not flushed yet
    >>>     some_long_process()
    >>>
    Warning message!  # the warning is flushed here

.fi
.PP
 
.SS " Iterator[logging\&.Handler] sphinx\&.util\&.logging\&.pending_warnings ()"

.PP
.nf
Context manager to postpone logging warnings temporarily\&.

Similar to :func:`pending_logging`\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.SS " Iterator[None] sphinx\&.util\&.logging\&.prefixed_warnings (str prefix)"

.PP
.nf
Context manager to prepend prefix to all warning log records temporarily\&.

For example::

    >>> with prefixed_warnings('prefix:'):
    >>>     logger\&.warning('Warning message!')  # => prefix: Warning message!

\&.\&. versionadded:: 2\&.0

.fi
.PP
 
