.SS " Iterator[\fBMemoryHandler\fP] sphinx\&.util\&.logging\&.suppress_logging ()"

.PP
.nf
Context manager to suppress logging all logs temporarily\&.

For example::

    >>> with suppress_logging():
    >>>     logger\&.warning('Warning message!')  # suppressed
    >>>     some_long_process()
    >>>

.fi
.PP
 
